  "summary": "Inside `loom chat`, slash commands include /help, /reset, /list, /mock, /view, /scan <dir> (with resume/reset), /abort, and /exit; Tab autocompletes commands and arrow keys navigate persisted history. The combined `loom serve` mode serves the web viewer at /, documentation APIs at /api/docs, /api/schemas, /api/entities, and mock routes under /mock/... on one port.",
